<title>JAPAN: Fujikura up on report on better earnings.</title>
<headline>Fujikura up on report on better earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in electric wire and cable manufacturer Fujikura Ltd rose on Wednesday morning, helped by a newspaper report saying the firm is likely to report better-than-expected earnings in the business year to March 31.</p>
<p>At 0118 GMT, the issue was up 28 yen at 938 yen, with 755,000 shares traded.</p>
